@startgantt gantt
'==============================================================================
' Figure (Chapter IV, Engineering foundations and the delivery process):
' project timeline of the internship as a Gantt chart.
' Four phase bars: Phase 0 (foundations) -> Phase 1 (MVP) -> Phase 2
' (enterprise features) -> planned R&D on the event-sourced system.
' Dates grounded in the roadmap (planning-doc/clmpilot-roadmap.md):
'   - Phase 0: repositories/CI/CD/dev environment, weeks of 2026-04-13/20
'     (repos created 2026-04-17; roadmap "Week 1-2").
'   - Phase 1: MVP LAUNCHED 2026-04-30; launch checklist and follow-ups
'     closed by 2026-05-19.
'   - Phase 2: enterprise features; epics closed 2026-07-02.
'   - R&D pivot decided 2026-06-26; the effort covers the remaining
'     internship time. Its END DATE below is an ASSUMPTION (end of August)
'     -- adjust to the real internship end before rendering.
' Render:  plantuml -tsvg gantt.puml  then  rsvg-convert -f pdf
'==============================================================================
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica

printscale weekly zoom 2
Project starts 2026-04-13

[Phase 0 -- Foundations] starts 2026-04-13 and ends 2026-04-24
[Phase 0 -- Foundations] is colored in #5D6D7E

[Phase 1 -- MVP] starts 2026-04-27 and ends 2026-05-19
[Phase 1 -- MVP] is colored in #5D6D7E
[MVP live in production] happens 2026-04-30

[Phase 2 -- Enterprise features] starts 2026-05-20 and ends 2026-07-02
[Phase 2 -- Enterprise features] is colored in #5D6D7E
[Pilot complete] happens 2026-07-02

[R&D on the event-sourced system (planned)] starts 2026-06-29 and ends 2026-08-28
[R&D on the event-sourced system (planned)] is colored in #D5D8DC
@endgantt
